<title>USA: Kellwood to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Kellwood to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kellwood Co said it will buy back up to 10 percent of its roughly 21.2 million outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>Shares in the apparel maker were up 1/4 at 16-5/8.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
